    <div class="sell-intro-grid">
      <div class="sell-intro-content">
        <div class="section-eyebrow">Seller Services</div>
        <h2>Selling Your Home Has Never Been Easier</h2>
        <p>Toronto Homes has helped hundreds of toronto homeowners sell their properties for top dollar. With a proven marketing strategy, extensive network, and deep market knowledge, John delivers results that exceed expectations.</p>
        <div class="sell-highlights">
          <div class="sell-highlight"><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i><span>Average sale in 21 days or less</span></div>
          <div class="sell-highlight"><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i><span>Professional photography & staging consultation</span></div>
          <div class="sell-highlight"><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i><span>MLS & major portal syndication</span></div>
          <div class="sell-highlight"><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i><span>Digital marketing on social media</span></div>
